    [x] Get user input
    [] Validate user input
    [] Call the function to handle that action
  [] Add ability to create a new task.
    - The function should take one argument: the description of the task.
  [] Add ability to update tasks.
    - The function should take two arguments: the task ID, and the amended description.
  [] Add ability to delete tasks.
    - The function should take one argument: the task ID.
    [] Add confirmation message before deleting the task.
  [] Add ability to mark a task as done.
    - The function should take one argument: the task ID.
  [] Add ability to mark a task as in progress.
    - The function should take one argument: the task ID.
  [] Add ability to list all tasks.
    - The list funtion should take one OPTIONAL argument: the status to filter by.
  [] Add ability to list finished tasks.
  [] Add ability to list in progress tasks.
  [] Add ability to list unfinished tasks.
  [] Add metadata to the list items.
    [] id: A unique identifier for the task
    [] description: A short description of the task
    [] status: The status of the task (todo, in-progress, done)
    [] createdAt: The date and time when the task was created
    [] updatedAt: The date and time when the task was last updated
  [] Store created tasks.
